Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 15:45:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Throttle speed limit by coolant temperature (pro-style)

Optional opening and closing speed curves (%/s) by CLT for the
electronic throttle target, applied before the ETB rev limiter so that
one is never slowed down. 0 in a point means no limit.

